the  current  time of day.  If the file doesn’t exist, it is cre‐
ated with default permissions.  The following options are  avail‐
able:  Change the access time of the file.  The modification time
of the file is not changed unless the flag is also specified.  Do
not create the file if it does not exist.  The utility  does  not
